	measure 'Revenue vs Budget' = ```
			
			        SUMX (
			            VALUES ( dim_date[Year Month] ),
			            IF ( NOT ISBLANK ( [Revenue Budget] ), [Revenue Actual] - [Revenue Budget] )
			        )
			```
		formatString: 0
		lineageTag: f60cb836-69a8-402d-9c77-8eb0b7a8df83

	measure 'Opex vs Budget' = ```
			
